Now fix 2: context_monitor.js cooldown bug.

Current code in evaluate() at lines 61-65:
```js
if (result.reason === 'cooldown' && state.context.lastReason === 'ready') {
  ready = true;
  decision = '本轮推荐已经送达';
  emit();
  return;
}
